From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: minhmc2007 <quangminh21072010@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 17:36:48 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] hbm: use libash_rust, the name SDK 36 provides

hbm on refs/heads/main references libash_latest_rust, which no project in
a LineageOS 23.2 tree defines. android-crates-io at the android16-qpr2
branch that upstream WayDroid-ATV pairs with this manifest names the ash
crate libash_rust, and so does the LineageOS copy.

soong bootstrap failed with:
  error: external/rust/hbm/Android.bp:7:1: module "libhbm" variant
  "android_vendor_x86_64_rlib_rlib-std": unable to find allowed
  variation for lib "libash_latest_rust"
---
 Android.bp | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/Android.bp b/Android.bp
index cd62c02..2e7b7a7 100644
--- a/Android.bp
+++ b/Android.bp
@@ -12,7 +12,7 @@ rust_library {
         "hbm_defaults",
     ],
     rustlibs: [
-        "libash_latest_rust",
+        "libash_rust",
         "libbitflags",
         "libdrm_rust",
         "liblibc",
